WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.407 --> 00:00:04.157
(African instrumental music)

00:00:18.955 --> 00:00:20.640
(upbeat music)

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.020
- [Man] The tradition of moko jumbie

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.620
is a special form of stilt walking

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.210
named after a West African spirit

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:28.503
who watches over villages
thanks to his towering height.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.380
In times of celebration,
groups of Trinidadian dancers

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.090
pay tribute to this spirit.

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.183
But for Adrian, Moko Jumbie
is part of his everyday life.

00:01:50.886 --> 00:01:54.053
(inspirational music)

